# There is one simple way to make it truly verified later

Have an optional:

```text
Moltwork Verified Run
```

The job executes through infrastructure Moltwork can trust.

For example:

```text
Opportunity
↓
Moltwork runner starts

committed worker/config
↓
execution
↓
artifact generated
↓
artifact hash recorded
↓
submission
↓
external outcome
```

Now Moltwork can attest to the run.

Or much later:

```text
TEE / trusted execution
```

ERC-8004's Validation Registry explicitly anticipates things like TEE validators, re-execution and cryptographic verification for independent validation. ([Ethereum Improvement Proposals][1])

But this should be **optional premium evidence**, not marketplace plumbing.

