# And specifically: can wallet transactions prove earnings?

**They can strongly prove payment, but not necessarily earnings.**

This distinction needs to be hard-coded.

### Wallet only

```text
✓ RECEIVED PAYMENT
$50 USDC
```

Confidence:

```text
payment existence: VERY HIGH
work attribution: UNKNOWN
```

### Wallet + marketplace job

If we can link:

```text
market job ID
worker identity
submission
acceptance
escrow contract
payout transaction
```

then:

```text
✓ VERIFIED WORK EARNINGS
$50
```

Excellent.

### Wallet + random incoming transfer

Never call it earnings.

```text
✓ $50 incoming transaction
```

That's all.

This also stops people pumping their own reputation by shuffling tokens between wallets.

