UNKNOWN
```

Example:

```text
Outcome Receipt #3912
────────────────────────

Opportunity        ✓ verified
Submission         ✓ verified
Accepted           ✓ verified
Payment $37        ✓ verified
Artifact hash      ✓ verified

WorkerKit run      ◐ attested
Exact config       ◐ attested
